  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Physical Space for Innovation Lab is set, and team members from different government entities is chosen and functional .</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">No Innovational lab is in existence at Bahrain Institute for Public Administration, which caters for different government entities in terms of providing capacity developmental training and introduction of new public administration solutions.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Organize a virtual study visit to international &#x2018;good practice&#x2019; PAIL. 
2. Support innovation delegation Teams in developing/finalizing their projects. 
3. Organize 2 more Innovation Leadership Discussion session.
4. Sponsoring of awarded projects from BIPA leadership Programs
5. Organize public service &#x2018;hackatons&#x2019;</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	Two virtual study visits to international &#x2018;good practice&#x2019; PAIL were completed. 
-	projects proposals from innovation delegation Teams were developed and to be finalized by end of 3rd quarter. 
-	public service &#x2018;Hackaton&#x2019; has been organized in cooperation with University of Bahrain, and final winning proposals will be announced by end of August 2021.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Organize a study visit to international &#x2018;good practice&#x2019; PAIL 
2.	Organize Innovation Leadership Discussion session.
3.	Integration of innovation tools/methods into BIPA leadership programs
4.	Sponsoring of awarded projects from BIPA leadership Programs
5.	Initiate &#x2018;Big Ticket&#x2019; public sector innovations 
6.	Organize public service &#x2018;hackatons&#x2019; 
7.	Establish and organize the Bahrain Public Service Innovation Month, upon approval from Deputy Prime Minister Office. 
8.	Establish Exhibition Space , upon approval from Deputy Prime Minister Office</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. A comprehensive series of intensive workshops in building the innovative capacity of civil servants and public sector operations and services were delivered. The series of workshops came as a full fledged programme and lasted for 6 months. 
2. A team from the mentioned trained group (consisted of 5 individuals (2 males and 3 females) participated in a regional Hackathon organized by Kuwait CO, and won the first prize. 
3. Innovation tools/methods into BIPA leadership training programs were integrated
4. 3 Innovation Leadership Discussion session were organized.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final Evaluation report</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final Evaluation report concluded</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
